// Blocks and ByHash and Tip has advanced — while index.mu is still held and
// before the accepting Append returns. It is nil in production; Append/Reorg
// interleaving tests park a successful append here so the block is committed
// but the call has not returned, forcing a concurrent Reorg (or a concurrent
// Append) to acquire the lock against exactly that intermediate state instead
// of relying on scheduling luck.
